		<description translatable="no">
			<ul>
				<li>Fixed crash in debug tools on Java 22+</li>
				<li>Fixed crash when showing empty POPUP ChoiceGroup</li>
				<li>Fixed handling of Graphics translation in M3G</li>
				<li>Fixed Sprint Media API</li>
				<li>Fixed item command not showing in left softkey label</li>
