				<li>Removed SWT 2D engine</li>
				<li>Added 320x480 device preset</li>
				<li>Added option to exclude images from objects size in Memory View</li>
				<li>Added custom class watcher view for Hashtable</li>
				<li>Added datagram support</li>
				<li>Added MascotME as micro3d software engine</li>
				<li>Initial macOS support in IDEA setup</li>
				<li>Removed discord rich presence</li>
				<li>Fixed TiledBackground in Siemens API</li>
				<li>Fixed M3G View on Java 9+</li>
				<li>Improved AMR support in multi-platform build</li>
				<li>Fixed rendering to texture in LWJGL M3G engine</li>
				<li>Fixed loading of 4-bit indexed PNG</li>
			</ul>
		</description>

